# ============================================================
# SehatLine frontend env — copy to ".env" (optional).
# ============================================================
#
# By default the app AUTO-DETECTS the backend IP from the Expo dev server,
# so if you run `npx expo start` and `node server.js` on the SAME PC, you
# don't need to set anything.
#
# To point the app at a SPECIFIC backend IP (backend on another machine, or
# auto-detect failing), set ONE of these and restart Expo:

# Just the backend IP (port 5000 is assumed):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_IP=192.168.1.11

# ...or a full URL (with or without /api):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.11:5000
